This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is the pk_py heredoc and the pre-suite step key span of .githooks/pre-push -- the
distribution's own gate, which install.sh never ships. The consumer's pre-push is
core/git-hooks/pre-push, a different program that carries no pk_py and no pre-suite keys, so on a
consumer this fixture would find no subject.
